{
 "title": "Cold rebuild: sk's command words",
 "summary": "Rebuild ResolveCommand from memory, no hints.",
 "minutes": 10,
 "steps": [
  {
   "type": "learn",
   "title": "Cold rebuild",
   "body": [
    "Time to prove a piece stuck. You built **ResolveCommand** in *Switch*. Now write it again from an",
    "**empty editor**: no starter, no hints, no solution to peek at. The tests are exactly the ones you passed",
    "the first time.",
    "",
    "Why: pulling something out of memory is what makes it stay there. Reading your old code feels like knowing",
    "it; rebuilding it cold shows whether you do. If you get stuck, that is useful news: go back to the lesson,",
    "then come back and try again tomorrow.",
    "",
    "This check, plus the boss, is what proves the module."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "predict",
   "prompt": "What does this print?",
   "code": [
    "string w = \"  LS \".Trim().ToLower();",
    "string name = w switch",
    "{",
    "    \"l\" or \"ls\" or \"list\" => \"list\",",
    "    _ => w,",
    "};",
    "Console.WriteLine(name);"
   ],
   "answer": "list",
   "explain": "Trimmed and lower-cased, `\"  LS \"` is `\"ls\"`, which the `or` pattern matches."
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "title": "Rebuild ResolveCommand cold",
   "cold": true,
   "timeLimit": 600,
   "coldOf": "csharp/02-control-flow/02-switch#12",
   "prompt": [
    "Your code becomes the body of `static string ResolveCommand(string word)`; put the command name in `result`.",
    "Trim and lower-case `word`, then use a switch expression with `or` patterns (no `if`):",
    "",
    "| Words | Command |",
    "|---|---|",
    "| `` (nothing), `t`, `today` | `today` |",
    "| `a`, `add`, `new` | `add` |",
    "| `d`, `done`, `finish` | `done` |",
    "| `s`, `start` | `start` |",
    "| `x`, `stop` | `stop` |",
    "| `l`, `ls`, `list` | `list` |",
    "| `su`, `standup` | `standup` |",
    "| `w`, `week` | `week` |",
    "| `f`, `find`, `search` | `find` |",
    "| `h`, `-h`, `--help`, `?`, `help` | `help` |",
    "| `-v`, `--version`, `version` | `version` |",
    "| anything else | the cleaned word itself |"
   ],
   "starter": "",
   "solution": [
    "string w = word.Trim().ToLower();",
    "result = w switch",
    "{",
    "    \"\" or \"t\" or \"today\" => \"today\",",
    "    \"a\" or \"add\" or \"new\" => \"add\",",
    "    \"d\" or \"done\" or \"finish\" => \"done\",",
    "    \"s\" or \"start\" => \"start\",",
    "    \"x\" or \"stop\" => \"stop\",",
    "    \"l\" or \"ls\" or \"list\" => \"list\",",
    "    \"su\" or \"standup\" => \"standup\",",
    "    \"w\" or \"week\" => \"week\",",
    "    \"f\" or \"find\" or \"search\" => \"find\",",
    "    \"h\" or \"-h\" or \"--help\" or \"?\" or \"help\" => \"help\",",
    "    \"-v\" or \"--version\" or \"version\" => \"version\",",
    "    _ => w,",
    "};"
   ],
   "template": [
    "static string ResolveCommand(string word)",
    "{",
    "    string result = \"\";",
    "{{CODE}}",
    "    return result;",
    "}",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"today\\\" means today\", \"today\", ResolveCommand(\"today\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"T\\\" means today\", \"today\", ResolveCommand(\"T\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"\\\" means today\", \"today\", ResolveCommand(\"\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"  ls \\\" means list\", \"list\", ResolveCommand(\"  ls \"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"Add\\\" means add\", \"add\", ResolveCommand(\"Add\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"new\\\" means add\", \"add\", ResolveCommand(\"new\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"finish\\\" means done\", \"done\", ResolveCommand(\"finish\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"d\\\" means done\", \"done\", ResolveCommand(\"d\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"s\\\" means start\", \"start\", ResolveCommand(\"s\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"x\\\" means stop\", \"stop\", ResolveCommand(\"x\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"su\\\" means standup\", \"standup\", ResolveCommand(\"su\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"W\\\" means week\", \"week\", ResolveCommand(\"W\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"search\\\" means find\", \"find\", ResolveCommand(\"search\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"--help\\\" means help\", \"help\", ResolveCommand(\"--help\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"?\\\" means help\", \"help\", ResolveCommand(\"?\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"-v\\\" means version\", \"version\", ResolveCommand(\"-v\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"receipt\\\" means receipt\", \"receipt\", ResolveCommand(\"receipt\"));",
    "Dojo.Eq(\"\\\"Shell\\\" means shell\", \"shell\", ResolveCommand(\"Shell\"));"
   ],
   "require": [
    {
     "pattern": "\\bswitch\\b",
     "message": "Uses a switch expression"
    },
    {
     "pattern": "\\bor\\b",
     "message": "Joins alternatives with or"
    }
   ],
   "explain": "Same tests as the original ResolveCommand. It is in your memory now, not just in your Sidekick.",
   "forbid": [
    {
     "pattern": "\\bif\\b",
     "message": "Does not use if"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
